    println!("syntactic aspects of selections.");
    println!();
    println!("Each analysis tool requires a different number of selections and the");
    println!("selections are interpreted differently. The general idea is still the same:");
    println!("each selection evaluates to a set of positions, where a position can be an");
    println!("atom position or center-of-mass or center-of-geometry of a set of atoms. The");
